cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "evoproto: reference implementation of an evidence-gated, evolution-informed engineering design framework"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the framework described in "From Evolutionary
  Biology Data to Technological Prototypes: An AI-Driven Engineering Design
  Framework with an Evidence-Gated Validation Protocol". It provides the
  evolutionary-engineering knowledge graph, phylogenetic signal and convergence
  measures, analog retrieval with a transfer-uncertainty measure, constrained
  multi-objective search, the evidence gate with its abstention branch, the
  three-arm experimental protocol with its statistical analysis plan, and the
  scripts that regenerate every figure of the paper. The package runs in
  synthetic mode: no biological records are bundled.
